    "description": "⚔️ DUNGEONS OF ANTROM ⚔️\n\nGrab your friends and raid the dungeons! Pick your hero 🛡️ Vanguard, 🪓 Berserker, 🏹 Scout or 🗡️ Striker, then fight through the Dark Fortress, the Fallen Crown, the Dwarven Forge and the Crypt. Beat the boss, grab the loot 💰 and level up your gear at the Upgrade Pit 🔥\n\n🎃 HALLOWEEN EVENT: GRAVEWATCH 🎃 (until Nov 7)\n👻 The Barrow Run: outrun the ghouls down the haunted road\n🎡 Wheel of Bones: a free spin every day\n🎲 Gravewalk: roll the dice, walk the graves, win prizes\n😈 The Rising: Saturdays 9:15 PM ET, the whole server vs the Demon\n✨ Earn embers and claim 3 FREE limited wearables!\n\n👥 Up to 4 players per party · New dungeons added regularly · Daily rewards 🎁",
